msgctxt "96"
msgid "I don't get this city. Is it always like this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "Pretty much. You get used to it eventually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Mh?"

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Master Utabori? What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Your name is Rikiya, yes? Why didn't you show him your tattoo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"What, to a two-bit thug like that? He doesn't deserve the honor. No way he'd"
" appreciate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Besides, this viper's not some kinda tool to threaten bullshit punks with. "
"It's the spirit of Okinawa, etched on my back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Then now I ask, why didn't you hit him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "What would've been the point? That guy wasn't worth the effort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "I see. You're a fascinating one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr "Che cosa vorresti dire?"

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Come with me. I'll finish that viper for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "You will!? But why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"Because I've come to understand your character. Do you need more reason than"
" that, boy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Hey, I'm not complainin'! Let's get that needle moving!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr "Urgh..."

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"That all you got? I was expectin' you big city boys to put up more of a "
"fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Th... Thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Heh, it was nothing. Now get outta here, okay? And next time, lay off the "
"booze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Oh, we will! I'm never drinking again, mark my words! Come on, honey! Let's "
"go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Look at the mister bigshot, comin' to save the day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"I see you hung my boys out to dry. Good. They deserve a nice ass-whooping "
"for starting shit where everyone can see 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Huh? Who the hell're you?"
msgstr "Eh? Chi cazzo sei!?"

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Who am I? Me!? Heh. You ain't from around here, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"There's not a soul in Kamurocho who doesn't know the name Hyoei Muroto!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Mh?"

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"I'm so sorry! You thugs are all looking for a quick buck, right? Here, take "
"my wallet! Just don't hurt us, please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"\"Thugs,\" he says. First you slam your drunk asses into us, and now you "
"insult us! We're gonna need more than whatever mothballs you got in your "
"pocket to cover our hospital bills."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "But... that's all I have on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Well that's an easy fix, ain't it? There's an ATM right over there. How "
"about we make a little withdrawal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Please, I can barely afford rent as is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Leave them alone. You're not hurt, you're just fakin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "And who're you, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"Didn't your kindergarten teachers ever tell you to mind your own damn "
"business?"
msgstr ""

